        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love cats? How about a bit of chaos, strategy, and cuteness all mixed together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then welcome to Istanbul's purr-fect neighborhood. Run your own little cat business in the heart of where East meets West, team up with uniquely talented Turkish feline friends, grow your production — and make some lira along the way. It may look adorable on the surface… but beneath it lies a system that rewards smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/3af29ebb9839dd26b7125ea5d8f9a8d7.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/3af29ebb9839dd26b7125ea5d8f9a8d7.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Historic Istanbul Setting</strong> – Build your cat empire across neighborhoods inspired by iconic Istanbul locations, from the Grand Bazaar to the Bosphorus waterfront. Meet legendary Turkish cat breeds in their natural habitat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Limited Space, Endless Possibilities</strong> – Make the most of Istanbul's narrow streets and compact shops. Every tile matters in this bustling metropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Cycle-Breaking Spirits</strong> – Special spirits inspired by Turkish folklore can turn the tide of a match — but triggering them takes skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Turkish Cat Collection</strong> – Collect dozens of cats including the swimming Turkish Van, and the beloved street cats that rule Istanbul's alleys, each with unique passive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Bazaar Shops, Turkish Treats &amp; More</strong> – Personalize your system with special items like simit stands, fish markets, and tea houses that boost your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Lira &amp; Rent System</strong> – Optimize your income and don't forget to pay your rent... or you'll be sleeping with the street cats under the Galata Bridge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Synergy &amp; Interaction</strong> – The way your cats interact can make or break your economy — just like the real cat colonies of Istanbul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit of Turkish tea, a bit of organized chaos — and a whole neighborhood of fur-covered economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Istanbul neighborhood, everyone finds their own way. Are you ready to find yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't miss the cutest corner of Istanbul. Add it to your wishlist!</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love cats? How about a bit of chaos, strategy, and cuteness all mixed together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then welcome to Istanbul's purr-fect neighborhood. Run your own little cat business in the heart of where East meets West, team up with uniquely talented Turkish feline friends, grow your production — and make some lira along the way. It may look adorable on the surface… but beneath it lies a system that rewards smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/3af29ebb9839dd26b7125ea5d8f9a8d7.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/3af29ebb9839dd26b7125ea5d8f9a8d7.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Historic Istanbul Setting</strong> – Build your cat empire across neighborhoods inspired by iconic Istanbul locations, from the Grand Bazaar to the Bosphorus waterfront. Meet legendary Turkish cat breeds in their natural habitat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Limited Space, Endless Possibilities</strong> – Make the most of Istanbul's narrow streets and compact shops. Every tile matters in this bustling metropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Cycle-Breaking Spirits</strong> – Special spirits inspired by Turkish folklore can turn the tide of a match — but triggering them takes skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Turkish Cat Collection</strong> – Collect dozens of cats including the swimming Turkish Van, and the beloved street cats that rule Istanbul's alleys, each with unique passive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Bazaar Shops, Turkish Treats &amp; More</strong> – Personalize your system with special items like simit stands, fish markets, and tea houses that boost your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Lira &amp; Rent System</strong> – Optimize your income and don't forget to pay your rent... or you'll be sleeping with the street cats under the Galata Bridge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Synergy &amp; Interaction</strong> – The way your cats interact can make or break your economy — just like the real cat colonies of Istanbul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit of Turkish tea, a bit of organized chaos — and a whole neighborhood of fur-covered economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Istanbul neighborhood, everyone finds their own way. Are you ready to find yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1762776396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras_big/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1762776396 width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't miss the cutest corner of Istanbul. Add it to your wishlist!</i></p>",
